<title>PHILIPPINES: Security Bank Q3 net up at 165.7 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Security Bank Q3 net up at 165.7 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ending Sept.</p>
<p>		    (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Total interest income     961.9 vs 614.8</p>
<p>    Total interest expense    457.2 vs 253.4</p>
<p>    Net income		    165.7 vs 152.5</p>
<p>Note: Full name Security Bank Corp.</p>
